+ *
+ * A is logically M x K, B is K x N, and D is an M x N cooperative tensor
+ * in metal.cooperative_tensor storage. This operation overwrites D and does
+ * not read its previous contents. The remaining participation, bounds,
+ * storage, shape, and precision requirements are identical to
+ * cooperative_tensor_multiply_accumulate_from_memory.
+ */
+TVM_DLL const Op& cooperative_tensor_multiply_from_memory();
